## 9. The framework (Maestro)

Framework **Maestro** in `Maestro/`, **read-only** (syncing replaces the whole folder —
`Maestro/playbooks/sync-framework.md`); map in `Maestro/README.md`; what each session reads in
`Maestro/workflows/README.md`. Version copied: {{the `Current version` line at the top of
`Maestro/_meta/VERSION.md`}} — the same number in `STATE.md` and in
`FRAMEWORK-IMPROVEMENTS.md`; if the framework evolves, it is updated deliberately (never by
drift). In Claude Code, `.claude/agents/maestro-*`, `.claude/skills/maestro-*` and the hooks are
generated from the specs by the scaffold (`Maestro/adapters/claude-code.md` §Executable
scaffold) — they are not edited by hand; they get regenerated at every phase transition and
after every sync.

